  speaker:
  - Little Girl
  - Mother
  - Mother
  - Little Girl
  - Mother
  - Mother
  - Mother
  - Little Girl
  - Little Girl
  dialogue:
  - Good morning, Mother. You wanted to see me?
  - Yes, honey.
  - Your... Father tells me you went into his study without permission.
  - No, Mother I-
  - I don't want to hear it!
  - Tonight you will think about the lies you've told, and tomorrow, at dinner, we
    will give you your punishment!
  - Understood?!
  - Yes, Mother...
  - '*Thinking* I need to get down to the safehouse tonight, before I''m grounded.'
  portrait:
  - {fileID: 21300000, guid: 7974f0af01e77c2459ba5035c58aff24, type: 3}
